":"RobRedEyes2","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":147536429,"name":"Field of Battle","desc":"Field of Battle is a medieval fantasy combat game where Humans and Orcs clash in epic battles to emerge victorious throughout the realms. Fight alongside players and NPCs to slay your foes in many fierce battles while you advance your character, forge legendary gear, and master your skills to become an epic champion. Join and begin your quest to rise to the top as the most powerful warrior!\n\nOfficial FOB Group: https://www.roblox.com/groups/group.aspx?gid=2982086","path":"/game/147536429-field-of-battle","slug":"147536429-field-of-battle","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6750752161f8ccb1fa3e00cbb31faf5a775265ee2160b26e804a413508fedcc3.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ebcae879c883e0ae203c5d381846c7b5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":11,"visitor":69650603,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2023-08-21T10:02:27.415Z","creator":{"name":"rcouret","type":"User"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":534701013,"name":"The Labyrinth","desc":"There are mazes of all shapes and sizes.\r\nMazes can be built with corn, mirrors, or fences.\r\nThey'll lead you to a dead end with winding paths and twists. \r\n\r\nOf course, if you're lucky, it's possible to find an exit.\r\n\r\nBut one thing all mazes have in common is a sense of excitement, indecision, and a desperate desire to escape.\r\n\r\nWill you be able to overcome the next maze? Are you brave enough to face the traps, monsters, and players in the dark realm along the way?\r\n\r\nYou can play solo or form a team with other players and use the resources you find to craft tools and weapons that will aid you on your journey through the labyrinth.\r\n\r\nThis game is based on The Maze Runner with a MMORPG touch to it.","path":"/game/534701013-the-labyrinth","slug":"534701013-the-labyrinth","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.